ghostscr: GNU Ghostscript version 2.6.1 - (with fixes 01-04 applied).
ghostscr: Preview, print and process postscript documents on both
ghostscr: Postscript and non-Postscript devices.
ghostscr: This version supports all SVGAlib video modes for output directly
ghostscr: to the screen. See the man page for "gs" for more information.
ghostscr: [NOTE]: The /usr/bin/gs binary included with this package does not 
ghostscr: support X11; support was left out so that Slackware users without X
ghostscr: windows could use SVGAlib output and not need to install the X shared
ghostscr: libraries. If you need X11 support, you should also install the 
ghostscr: package "gs_x11" found on the XAP series. It contains a /usr/bin/gs 
ghostscr: with support for X11 (as well as full SVGAlib support).
